No obvious red flags by phone but limited assessment. DDx: viral LRTI incl COVID/other resp virus, early bacterial CAP, ?pertussis, PE unlikely from hx.

Plan (a bit out of order):

– Scripts:  
• Doxycycline 100 mg PO BD x 7 days (PBS). Counselling re upright with water, food if nausea, photosensitivity – discussed briefly.  
